    "summary": "Spend 1 CP as the opposing player's [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) begins, on an **ABERRANTS**, **BIOPHAGUS** or **PURESTRAIN GENESTEALERS** unit of yours. Until the phase ends, when an enemy unit is picked to shoot while within 9\" of it:\n\n1. That enemy unit takes a Leadership test, with -1 to the result.\n2. If it fails, its models' attacks against your unit get -1 to their [Hit rolls](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls) for the rest of the phase.",
